%% 英语学习进度系统 · 核心时序图汇总（4 张，详见架构设计文档 §3）
%% 详细版（含参与者说明）见《架构设计-英语学习进度系统.md》第三部分

%% ===== ① 每日学习流程 =====
sequenceDiagram
    participant Boot as app/boot.ts
    participant Sched as MRCS(expand)
    participant UI as StudyPage
    participant Feed as FeedbackPanel
    participant Repo as repos
    participant IDB as Dexie 离线队列
    participant Cloud as 云数据库
    Boot->>Repo: 登录态检查
    Boot->>Sched: getTodayQueue(today)
    Sched->>Sched: expandSchedule(plan,date)（纯函数，确定性ID幂等写入）
    Sched->>Repo: 读/写当日 hits
    Repo->>IDB: 预缓存队列+音频
    Boot->>Boot: 欠账检查（超阈值→拦截，见②）
    UI->>Feed: hit完成：reaction_ms+L1(+L2/L3)
    alt 在线
        Repo->>Cloud: 写 hit.status=done + feedbacks
    else 离线
        Repo->>IDB: 入 pending_ops
    end
    Repo->>Cloud: sessions + session_summaries → sync 补传（5s跨端可见）

%% ===== ② 欠账检测与重排 =====
sequenceDiagram
    participant Boot as boot
    participant Sched as MRCS(overdue)
    participant Repo as repos
    actor 用户
    participant Panel as ReschedulePanel
    participant Ver as planVersion
    Boot->>Sched: computeOverdue(today)
    Sched->>Repo: 读 pending/overdue hits
    alt count>2×dailyHits 或 连续3天未学
        Boot-->>用户: 强制弹重排面板
        用户->>Panel: 四选一（A展期/B压缩/C降轮/D冻结，配大白话）
        Panel->>Sched: previewStrategy → 影响预览
        用户->>Panel: 选定（可勾选 deferred 子集）
        Panel->>Sched: applyStrategy
        Sched->>Sched: 展期不得突破 2026-12-05
        Sched->>Ver: 快照→新 PlanVersion
        Sched->>Repo: 重写 hits，债务清零+变更日志
        Panel->>Boot: 放行进入正常学习
    end

%% ===== ③ AI 提案→确认→生效→回滚 =====
sequenceDiagram
    participant Trig as 触发器(手动/事件/定时)
    participant LLM as llmClient
    participant Auth as authz
    participant Prop as proposal
    participant Log as ToolCallLog
    actor 用户
    participant Ver as planVersion
    Trig->>LLM: 发起
    LLM->>LLM: 读工具(get_*，只读)
    LLM->>Auth: 写操作+diff+reason
    Auth->>Log: 落 ToolCallLog
    alt Auto
        Auth->>Ver: 直接落地+记版本
    else Confirm/Require
        Auth->>Prop: AIProposal(pending, 必含reason+diff)
        Prop-->>用户: diff+理由+影响预览
        alt 确认
            用户->>Ver: 生效→新PlanVersion
        else 驳回
            用户->>Log: rejected（连续3次→降级仅建议）
        end
    end
    用户->>Ver: 回滚到 vN（也记版本）

%% ===== ④ TTS 合成与回退 =====
sequenceDiagram
    actor 用户
    participant UI as WordCard
    participant Orc as tts/orchestrator
    participant Cache as audioCache
    participant NP as neuralProvider
    participant EP as espeakProvider
    participant Repo as pronunciationRepo
    用户->>UI: 点击🔊
    UI->>Orc: getAudio({text,ipa,mode})
    Orc->>Cache: 查缓存
    alt 命中
        Cache-->>UI: 播放<800ms
    else 未命中 & status=active
        Orc->>NP: SSML(phoneme IPA)
        alt 成功
            NP-->>Orc: audio→写缓存→Log(neural_tts)
        else 失败/超时
            Orc->>EP: IPA直读→Log(fallback_used=true)+轻提示一次
        end
    else pending_user_setup
        Orc->>EP: IPA直读兜底
        EP-->>Orc: audio→Log(fallback_used=true)
    end
    Orc-->>UI: 播放
